WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.772
Farmer came out of the house.

2
00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:17.178
He went into the garden.

3
00:00:17.179 --> 00:00:22.474
"Time to pick some carrots," said Farmer.

4
00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:25.338
Farmer looked around.

5
00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:29.433
Farmer saw lots of vegetables.

6
00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:33.605
But he did not see any carrots.

7
00:00:33.606 --> 00:00:39.563
"Who took my carrots?" said Farmer.

8
00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:45.370
Groundhog came back to the barn.

9
00:00:45.371 --> 00:00:50.677
He had a big pile of carrots.

10
00:00:50.678 --> 00:00:55.173
"Wow!" said Pig.

11
00:00:55.174 --> 00:00:58.259
"That is a lot of food!"

12
00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:07.891
"Yum!" said Cow.

13
00:01:07.892 --> 00:01:12.247
"These carrots taste very good."

14
00:01:12.248 --> 00:01:18.786
"They are yummy!" said Bat.

15
00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:23.623
"Mmm," said Dog.

16
00:01:23.624 --> 00:01:27.465
"Carrots taste better than dog food."

17
00:01:27.466 --> 00:01:31.377
"This is a great feast," said Cat.

18
00:01:31.378 --> 00:01:34.914
"Where did you find these carrots?"

19
00:01:34.915 --> 00:02:02.201
"Right here on the farm!" said Groundhog.

